This workflow bundles icon artwork from Material Design Icons by the
Pictogrammers icon group (https://pictogrammers.com/), redistributed here as
rendered PNG files and as extracted SVG path data inside meta.json.

The icons are NOT covered by this project's MIT license. They are redistributed
under the upstream Pictogrammers Free License (icons under Apache License 2.0),
reproduced verbatim below.

Modifications by this project: the original SVG sources were converted to PNG
raster images and their path data was extracted into a JSON index. No artwork
was otherwise altered.

Note: Apache License 2.0 does not grant trademark rights. Brand and logo icons
included in the set may be subject to the respective owners' trademarks,
independent of the icon copyright license.

